---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: Legion operator triggers emergency
    q_check_caller --> q_transfer: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(to, token, amount), emit EmergencyWithdraw(token, to, amount)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Emergency withdraw bypasses normal sale state checks
        INV-002: Only Legion operators can execute (highest privilege)
        INV-003: Can withdraw any ERC20 token held by contract
    end note
